9033b9bf428d"],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Wolfram System Modeler\[NonBreakingSpace]is a very \
general environment that handles modeling of systems with mechanical, \
electrical, thermal, chemical, biological and other components, as well as \
combinations of different types of components. It\[CloseCurlyQuote]s based\
\[LongDash]like\[NonBreakingSpace]Wolfram Language\[LongDash]on the very \
general idea of representing everything in symbolic form.",
 FontSize->18,
 FontWeight->"Normal",
 FontSlant->"Italic",
 FontColor->RGBColor[
  0.5019607843137255, 0.5019607843137255, 0.5019607843137255]]], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.964243399307829*^9, 3.9642434146345615`*^9}, 
   3.9672042614214497`*^9, 3.967204318650084*^9, 
   3.982749388044221*^9},ExpressionUUID->"2f637163-8f78-324b-9f38-\
312a407d3975"],

Cell["\<\
Obtain all built-in examples in the Modelica rotational mechanics library:\
